      "status": "PRESENT",
      "chunk_id": "text_5",
      "quote": "The review encompasses (P) laypeople from diverse backgrounds, including different age groups, genders, socioeconomic statuses, ethnicities without any disability or systematic diseases. The focus is on (I) social media-based interventions that employ a group approach for information dissemination. The desired outcomes include (O) any changes in oral health status, knowledge, beliefs, and attitudes resulting from social media interventions. This includes short and long-term effects, regardless of the duration of follow-up. The full-text articles from 2012 to 2023 focus on randomized controlled trials (RCTs), quasi-randomized trials and field trials were included in the current study.",
      "reason": "The text explicitly specifies population, intervention, outcomes, follow-up duration, and eligible study designs as part of the eligibility criteria."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_5_e2",
      "status": "PRESENT",
      "chunk_id": "text_5",
      "quote": "The full-text articles from 2012 to 2023 focus on randomized controlled trials (RCTs), quasi-randomized trials and field trials were included in the current study. Studies that did not specifically target oral disease prevention or oral health promotion, were not based on social media approaches, had an intervention on oral health promotion of people with systematic disease or disability or were published in languages other than English were excluded. The conference proceedings, editorials, commentaries, review articles, pilot studies and all the studies that assessed the quality of the content of social media were excluded.",
      "reason": "The text specifies dissemination year (2012-2023), language (English), and publication/report status (full-text, excluding proceedings/editorials/reviews)."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_5_e3",
      "status": "NOT_APPLICABLE",
      "chunk_id": "text_9",
      "quote": "Reports excluded: Full article not founded (n=2) Not interventional (n=42) The intervention was not defined as using social media (n=8) Pilot study(n=2)",
      "reason": "The flow diagram shows exclusions based on availability, intervention type, and study design, but none are related to outcome measurement or reporting status, making the distinction requirement not applicable."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_5_e4",
      "status": "MISSING",
      "chunk_id": null,
      "quote": null,
      "reason": "While study characteristics are listed, the manuscript does not explicitly specify how studies were grouped for the syntheses or link these groups to the review objectives/comparisons."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_5_e5",
      "status": "MISSING",
      "chunk_id": null,
      "quote": null,
      "reason": "The manuscript lists eligibility restrictions (e.g., language, date range) but does not provide explicit rationales for these notable restrictions."
    }
  ],
  "confidence": 90
}

